# ---------- Compiled PDFs ----------
# main.pdf (slides) and handout.pdf (handout) are kept so students can
# download them. Uncomment the lines below to track only the LaTeX sources.
# **/Presentation/main.pdf
# **/Handouts/handout.pdf

# Preview PDFs shared during drafting (duplicates of the compiled PDFs)
*_preview.pdf

# Zip packages of the sources
*.zip

# ---------- Copyrighted textbook excerpts ----------
# Do not publish scanned/extracted textbook pages in a public repository.
Textbook Excerpt/
**/Textbook Excerpt/

